# expense_tracking.func

> Module: expense_tracking (Gider Takibi) | Category: FINANCE

## Purpose
Comprehensive expense tracking with 21 categories covering all aspects of Turkish trucking operations. Tracks every cost from fuel to insurance to office rent.

## Problems It Solves
- Trucking companies have diverse expense types across operations, maintenance, and admin
- Categorized tracking enables cost-center analysis
- Category summary reveals spending patterns
- Auto-sync from fuel_logs, maintenance (avoids double entry)
- Tax preparation: all expenses categorized for accountant

## Technical Database Structure
**Table:** `expenses`
| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | SERIAL PK | Unique identifier |
| tenant_id | INTEGER FK | Tenant isolation |
| kategori | expense_category_enum | Category |
| aciklama | TEXT | Description |
| tutar | DECIMAL(12,2) | Amount |
| tarih | DATE | Date |
| created_at, updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | Timestamps |

**Enum:** `expense_category_enum` (21 categories):
YAKIT, BAKIM, LASTIK, TAMIR, SIGORTA, MTV, TRAFIK_CEZASI, KOPRU_OTOYOL, MUAYENE, EGZOZ_EMISYON, TAKOGRAF, YETKI_BELGESI, MAAS, SGK, MUHASEBE, KIRA, ELEKTRIK_SU, INTERNET_TEL, YAZILIM_LISANS, OTOBAN_ABONMAN, DIGER

## User Interface
**ExpensesPage.tsx** — `/dashboard/expenses`
- DataGrid table: Kategori, Açıklama, Tutar, Tarih
- Category badges with color coding
- Add/Edit modal with category dropdown, amount, description, date
- Category summary sidebar/tab
- Filters by category, date range
- Export to CSV/Excel/PDF

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|--------|------|:---:|-------------|
| GET | `/api/tenant/expenses/` | Tenant JWT | List expenses |
| POST | `/api/tenant/expenses/` | Tenant JWT | Add expense |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/expenses/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Edit expense |
| DELETE | `/api/tenant/expenses/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Remove expense |
| GET | `/api/tenant/expenses/categories` | Tenant JWT | Category summary |

